      "entity_id": "claim:grothendieck-arbitrary-finite-kernel-monodromy-spectrum",
      "kind": "claim",
      "title": "Arbitrary finite kernels have a complete visible product-exponent power spectrum",
      "statement": "For any finite action rho:H->Aut(K) on any finite group K, all power-Mackey fiber squares commute iff gcd(n,exp(K)*exp(im rho))=1. Visible-prime necessity follows from the telescoping coboundary x^-1 alpha(x).",
